<h2><span id=3D"Before_we_start_.28step_1.2F3.29"></span><span class=3D"mw-=
headline" id=3D"Before_we_start_(step_1/3)">Before we start (step 1/3)</spa=
n><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">[</=
